From: Hojun Cho <ghwns6743@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 31 Aug 2026 11:14:52 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] pmdomain: apple: Add missing spin_lock_init

Signed-off-by: Hojun Cho <ghwns6743@gmail.com>
(cherry picked from commit afffea42ac29a1f6f8b3ef3819691c1d7b0a259a)
---
 drivers/pmdomain/apple/pmp-report.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/pmdomain/apple/pmp-report.c b/drivers/pmdomain/apple/pmp-report.c
index 8050ade..ee0dd1f 100644
--- a/drivers/pmdomain/apple/pmp-report.c
+++ b/drivers/pmdomain/apple/pmp-report.c
@@ -40,6 +40,7 @@ static int apple_pmp_report_probe(struct platform_device *pdev)
 	if (!rep)
 		return -ENOMEM;
 
+	spin_lock_init(&rep->lock);
 	rep->dev = dev;
 	rep->base = devm_platform_ioremap_resource(pdev, 0);
 	if (IS_ERR(rep->base))
